Error [jet.ToolJobConflict]: `serve` is already a job in ./main.jet
 Why: The project job `serve` wins in this directory, so the global tool would be shadowed here (JPK-TOOL-COLLIDE).
 Fix: Install under a different bin name with `jetpack tool install serve@jetpack --as <other>`, or run it once with `jetpack use serve@jetpack -- <command>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1297
